ll","width":{"unit":"%","size":"66.6666"}},"elements":[{"id":"8dc56b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Welcome to the Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology Department at Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences (GEIMS), a dedicated space committed to the comprehensive care of women's health.<\/p>","text_color":"#6B6B6B","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"e682435","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>GEIMS Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology Department: Nurturing Women's Health Across Lifecycles<\/strong><\/p>","text_color":"#65CC33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1be8986","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"#65CC33","weight":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"95d683c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Step into the realm of dedicated women's healthcare at the Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology Department of Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences (GEIMS). Our department stands as a beacon of education, innovation, and community service, addressing the unique healthcare needs of women across different stages of life.<\/p><p><strong>Holistic Women's Health Care:<\/strong><\/p><p>At GEIMS, the Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology Department plays a pivotal role in providing holistic healthcare to women. From routine gynecological check-ups to pregnancy and childbirth, our team of skilled obstetricians and gynecologists ensures personalized care tailored to the unique needs of each woman.<\/p><p><strong>Cutting-Edge Facilities:<\/strong><\/p><p>Immerse yourself in cutting-edge obstetrics and gynecology education with our state-of-the-art facilities. Our department is equipped with advanced diagnostic tools, maternity care units, and gynecological examination rooms, creating an environment that replicates real-world healthcare settings. This ensures that students receive hands-on training, preparing them for the diverse challenges of women's healthcare.<\/p><p><strong>Expert Faculty and Mentorship:<\/strong><\/p><p>At the core of our obstetrics and gynecology excellence is a team of experienced faculty\u2014obstetricians, gynecologists, and women's health specialists. Their diverse expertise provides students with a comprehensive learning experience. Beyond clinical skills, our faculty instills a commitment to ethical practice, continuous learning, and patient-centered care. Mentorship extends beyond textbooks, nurturing future healthcare professionals who are not only skilled but also empathetic and attuned to women's health needs.<\/p><p><strong>Comprehensive Curriculum:<\/strong><\/p><p>Delve into a meticulously crafted curriculum designed to instill a profound understanding of obstetric and gynecological principles and practices. Covering prenatal care to menopause management, our curriculum ensures graduates are well-prepared to address the diverse needs of women across different life stages.<\/p>","text_color":"#7A7A7A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":"1"},{"id":"5aefa4e","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"3c0f806","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33.3333"},"flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":"1","unit":"px","size":"10"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#3A3A3A","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":""},"_flex_align_self":"flex-start","_flex_size":"none","_flex_grow":"0","_flex_shrink":"0","sticky":"top","sticky_offset":"100","sticky_effects_offset":"100","s