0;O:8:"stdClass":3:{s:7:"post_id";s:4:"5945";s:8:"meta_key";s:24:"_elementor_template_type";s:10:"meta_value";s:7:"wp-page";}i:351;O:8:"stdClass":3:{s:7:"post_id";s:4:"5945";s:8:"meta_key";s:18:"_elementor_version";s:10:"meta_value";s:6:"3.25.4";}i:352;O:8:"stdClass":3:{s:7:"post_id";s:4:"5945";s:8:"meta_key";s:15:"_elementor_data";s:10:"meta_value";s:11764:"[{"id":"b651ee6","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0"},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":""}},"elements":[{"id":"deff3aa","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"66.6666"}},"elements":[{"id":"8dc56b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The Microbiology Department at GEIMS delves into the tiny organisms' world, teaching students about their roles in health, biotech, and nature. Explore disease, biotech, and ecological solutions in this fascinating field.<\/p>","text_color":"#6B6B6B","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"e682435","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>GEIMS Microbiology Department: Unraveling the Mysteries of Microscopic Worlds<\/strong><\/p>","text_color":"#65CC33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1be8986","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"#65CC33","weight":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"95d683c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The Microbiology Department serves as an academic beacon, immersing students in the intricate realm of microscopic life. With a student-centric approach, it nurtures scientific curiosity, offering comprehensive insight into the multifaceted roles of microorganisms in health, biotechnology, and environmental ecosystems. Through cutting-edge research and experiential learning, students explore the frontiers of disease control, bioprocessing, and ecological sustainability. The department primes future leaders with skills to tackle global challenges, offering pathways to careers in medicine, research, biotech industries, and environmental stewardship. Embracing innovation and collaboration paves the way for students to pioneer groundbreaking discoveries in this dynamic field.<\/p><p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Key Highlights<\/strong><\/p><p>Explore the Microbiology Department's dynamic realm, where microscopic wonders reveal their impact. Engage in cutting-edge research, uncovering their pivotal roles in health, biotechnology, and ecology, while forging paths toward impactful careers.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><ul><li>A comprehensive exploration of microscopic organisms' multifaceted impact on human health, biotechnology innovation, and environmental sustainability.<\/li><li>\u00a0<\/li><li>Engaging students in experiential learning through innovative research initiatives, offering hands-on experiences that amplify understanding.<\/li><li>\u00a0<\/li><li>Diverse and promising career pathways span medicine, cutting-edge research, biotechnological advancements, and ecological stewardship.<\/li><li>\u00a0<\/li><li>Cultivating an environment of innovation, collaboration, and interdisciplinary approaches, fostering groundbreaking scientific breakthroughs.<\/li><\/ul>","text_color":"#7A7A7A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":"1"},{"id":"5aefa4e","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"3c0f806","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33.3333"},