:"0"},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":""}},"elements":[{"id":"deff3aa","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"66.6666"}},"elements":[{"id":"8dc56b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>In the Anatomy Department, students explore the human body's structure, learning about organs, tissues, and systems, laying a foundation crucial for future medical practitioners and researchers.<\/p>","text_color":"#6B6B6B","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"e682435","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>GEIMS Anatomy Department: Unveiling the Wonders of the Human Body<\/strong><\/p>","text_color":"#65CC33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1be8986","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"#65CC33","weight":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"95d683c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The Anatomy Department immerses students in studying the intricate human body structure, encompassing organs, tissues, and systems pivotal for aspiring healthcare professionals and researchers. It cultivates a profound understanding foundational to medical practice. Prospects span diverse fields like medicine, surgery, research, and academia, offering pathways to impact healthcare. This department's rigorous training instils expertise essential for diagnostic precision and innovative medical advancements. Through hands-on learning and comprehensive education, students emerge adept at unravelling the human body's complexities, positioning themselves to contribute meaningfully to healthcare solutions and pioneering medical breakthroughs in evolving healthcare landscapes.<\/p><p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Key Highlights<\/strong><\/p><p>The Anatomy Department offers a comprehensive study of the human body, providing practical learning and foundational knowledge crucial for aspiring healthcare professionals. It prepares students for diverse career paths in medicine, surgery, and research, shaping adept individuals poised to contribute significantly to the healthcare landscape.<\/p><ul><li><strong>In-depth Human Anatomy Study:<\/strong> Comprehensive examination of the body's structures, including organs, tissues, and systems.<\/li><li><strong>Hands-on Learning:<\/strong> Practical training crucial for future healthcare professionals.<\/li><li><strong>Foundation for Medical Practice:<\/strong> Essential knowledge supporting careers in medicine, surgery, and research.<\/li><li><strong>Versatile Career Paths:<\/strong> Opportunities in healthcare, academia, and medical research.<\/li><\/ul>","text_color":"#7A7A7A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":"1"},{"id":"5aefa4e","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"3c0f806","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33.3333"},"flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":"1","unit":"px","size":"10"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#3A3A3A","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":""},"_flex_align_self":"flex-start","_flex_size":"none","_flex_grow":"0","_flex_shrink":"0","sticky_offset":"100","sticky_effects_offset":"100","sticky_parent":"yes","animation":"slideInUp","animation_duration":"fast","presetTitle":"Container","presetIcon":"eicon-container"},"elements":[{"id":"e7017ae","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer