UGC during Ph.D.<\/p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"488477d","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h4><strong>Awards<\/strong><\/h4><p>\u00a0<\/p><ul><li>Professor Krishna Sahai Bilgrami Memorial Medal in Agricultural Sciences by Indian National Science Academy-2021<\/li><li>J.C. Bose National Fellowship awarded by Department of Science and Technology, Govt. of India, 2011<\/li><li>Rafi Ahmed Kidwai Award for outstanding contribution in Natural Resource Management &amp; Agricultural Engineering awarded by Indian Council of Agricultural Research, 2010<\/li><li>Highly Cited researcher in recognition of exceptional research performance demonstrated by production of multiple highly cited papers that rank in top 1%for the field and year in Agricultural Sciences by Clarivate-2022<\/li><li>Highly Cited researcher in recognition of exceptional research performance demonstrated by production of multiple highly cited papers that rank in top 1%for the field and year in Agricultural Sciences by Clarivate-2021<\/li><li>Indian Research Excellence\u2013Citations Award in Agriculture Science awarded by Web of Science, 2019<\/li><li>Excellence in Carbohydrate Research Award awarded by Association of Carbohydrate Chemists &amp; Technologists, 2016<\/li><li>Ramana Fellowship awarded by Department of Science &amp; Technology, Govt. of India, 2007-2010<\/li><li>Recognition Award awarded by National Academy of Agricultural Sciences, 2007-2008<\/li><li>Laljee Godhoo Smarak Nidhi Award by Association of Food Scientists &amp; Technologists, India, 2005<\/li><li>C.N.R. Rao Educational Foundation Award by GNDU for Excellence in Research, 2007<\/li><li>Award of Honour by Alumni Association, College of Agriculture, PAU, Ludhiana, 2011<\/li><li>Certificate of Appreciation by Punjab Agricultural University, Ludhiana, 2012<\/li><li>S. Bishan Singh Samundri Memorial Lectureship Award awarded by Guru Nanak Dev University, Amritsar, 2012<\/li><li>Pran Vohra Award awarded by Indian Science Congress Association, 1997-1998<\/li><li>Appreciation Certificate awarded by Punjab State Council for Science and Technology, 1990-1993<\/li><li>Young Scientist Medal in Agricultural sciences awarded by Indian National Science Academy, 1993<\/li><li>Best Research Papers Awards awarded by Association of Food Scientists and Technologist India, 2007 &amp; 2016<\/li><\/ul>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"9594226","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h4>Position Held<\/h4><p>\u00a0<\/p><ul><li>Professor, Department of Food Science and Technology, Guru Nanak Dev University, (GNDU), Amritsar from 14-08-2000 to 31-12- 2022 (22 years), and<\/li><li>Reader: 07-04-1993 to 13-08-2000 (7 years 4 months), Department of Food Science and Technology, GNDU, Amritsar.<\/li><li>Assistant Professor: 29-03-1988 to 06-04-1993 (4 years 11 months), Department of Food Science and Technology, PAU, Ludhiana<\/li><li>Research Fellow (ICAR Project): 25-02-1985 to 14-11-1985, Department of Food Science and Technology, PAU, Ludhiana<\/li><li>Director of Research:10-05-2017 to 03-06-2020 (3 Years 0 Months), GNDU, Amritsar<\/li><li>Dean: (Faculty of Applied Sciences): 10-07-2010 to 30-06-2012; 04-08-2008 to 13-12-2009 (3 Years 3 Months), GNDU, Amritsar<\/li><li>Head: Department of Food Science &amp; Technology, GNDU, Amritsar: 01-07-2018 to 30-06-2021; 30-08-2001 to 28-06-2004; 06-06-1997 to 05-06-2000 (8 Years 11 months).<\/li><li>Coordinator: (Uni.-Industry Linkage Programme), GNDU: 12-11-2008 to 31-03-2012 (3 Years 4 Months)<\/li><li>Coordinator: (UGC-SAP), GNDU: 01-04-2012 to 31-03-2017 (5 Years).<\/li><li>Coordinator: (Centre for Advance Research in Food Sciences): 12-04-2006 to 22-03-2007 (11 Months).<\/li><\/ul><h4>\u00a0<\/h4><h4 class=\"x_elementToProof\"><b>Fellow<\/b><b>\u00a0<\/b><b>of<\/b><b>\u00a0<\/b><b>National<\/b><b>\u00a0<\/b><b>and<\/b><b>\u00a0<\/b><b>International<\/b><b>\u00a0<\/b><b>academies\/associations:<\/b><\/h4><p>\u00a0<\/p><ul><li d