"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"66.6666"}},"elements":[{"id":"8dc56b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Welcome to the Department of Emergency Medicine at Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences (GEIMS). It is the high-stakes, fast-paced heart of a hospital.<\/p>","text_color":"#6B6B6B","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"e682435","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>GEIMS Dermatology Department: Expert Care When Every Second Counts.<\/strong><\/p>","text_color":"#65CC33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":"21","sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1be8986","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"#65CC33","weight":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":"2","sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"95d683c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Comprehensive Trauma Infrastructure:<\/b> <span class=\"citation-44\">Specialized workflows for severe physical trauma, emphasizing multidisciplinary care for <\/span><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"126\"><span class=\"citation-44\">Road Traffic Accidents<\/span><\/b><span class=\"citation-44\"> (fractures, head, and spinal injuries) and <\/span><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"192\"><span class=\"citation-44\">Industrial Accidents<\/span><\/b><span class=\"citation-44 citation-end-44\"> (crush injuries, severe burns, and chemical exposures).<\/span><\/p><p><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Life-Threatening Pathologies:<\/b> <span class=\"citation-43 citation-end-43 interactive-span-hovered\">Bedside care protocols explicitly listed for acute conditions such as sudden cardiac arrest, severe internal\/external hemorrhaging, acute seizures, and drowning.<\/span><\/p><p><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Demographic-Specific Emergency Care:<\/b> Dedicated sections detailing tailored interventions for <b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">Pediatric<\/b> and <b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">Geriatric<\/b> emergencies, recognizing that children and elderly patients have distinct physiological needs during an acute crisis.<\/p><p><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">24\/7 On-Site Imaging:<\/b> <span class=\"citation-42 citation-end-42\">Real-time access to X-rays, high-speed CT scans, MRIs, and bedside ultrasounds for rapid evaluation of internal injuries.<\/span><\/p><p><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accelerated Lab Services:<\/b> <span class=\"citation-41 citation-end-41\">Dedicated turnaround protocols for toxicology screens, coagulation profiles, and rapid blood testing.<\/span><\/p><p><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Top Emergency Procedures:<\/b> <span class=\"citation-40 citation-end-40\">Visibility into immediate surgical capabilities, showcasing readiness for fracture fixations, emergency laparotomies, emergency neurosurgery, and advanced skin grafting.<\/span><\/p>","text_color":"#7A7A7A"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":"1"},{"id":"5aefa4e","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"3c0f806","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"33.3333"},"flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":"1","unit":"px","size":"10"},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#3A3A3A","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":""},"_flex_align_self":"flex-s